        "ru-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "041ae16f-efdc-3f15-9538-576059658294",
                "word": "потрясающе",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "314afe88-6c12-3b77-98bf-cea77a1c8c49",
                        "entry_id": "041ae16f-efdc-3f15-9538-576059658294",
                        "glosses": [
                            "наречие к потрясающий; производя сильное впечатление, вызывая сильные переживания"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "adverb"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "53260580-8c3c-49b5-903b-ee14345398dc",
                                "sense_id": "314afe88-6c12-3b77-98bf-cea77a1c8c49",
                                "text": "Когда Магомету было сорок лет, он имел первое божественное откровение, подействовавшее на него крайне потрясающе и бросившее его роковым образом на служение Богу."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "57abd252-cb69-4fa6-8d44-a7d819f8daa6",
                                "sense_id": "314afe88-6c12-3b77-98bf-cea77a1c8c49",
                                "text": "Немая, высохшая мать едва передвигала ноги, глядя на всё страшными глазами. брат был золотушный, с язвами на щиколотках, и такой слабенький, что даже плакать громко не мог, а только стонал потрясающе, если был голоден, сытый же дремал и сквозь дрёму как-то странно вздыхал, мурлыкал тихонько, точно котёнок."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4a36269d-2c0c-4231-81bc-33a3a90bffaf",
                                "sense_id": "314afe88-6c12-3b77-98bf-cea77a1c8c49",
                                "text": "Все эти цифры наших потерь давно были нам известны, но теперь, среди моря, на виду печального для нас острова Цусима, действовали на всех слушателей потрясающе."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "57594130-7948-3981-ac44-1351999981c1",
                        "entry_id": "041ae16f-efdc-3f15-9538-576059658294",
                        "glosses": [
                            "вызывая сотрясение; сотрясая"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bcb00afb-c972-4786-a388-cb6a4a171647",
                                "sense_id": "57594130-7948-3981-ac44-1351999981c1",
                                "text": "Целый день за невидимой теперь рекой, из-за сереющих казацких окопов, потрясающе ухали орудия."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "11b711ee-ac2a-33fd-b5c0-a7207bfaf3f3",
                        "entry_id": "041ae16f-efdc-3f15-9538-576059658294",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. в большой степени, удивительно, очень"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "33683263-9d26-45f0-89fe-32dad9c250fe",
                                "sense_id": "11b711ee-ac2a-33fd-b5c0-a7207bfaf3f3",
                                "text": "За этими дверями мрачные, потрясающе мрачные темничные кельи."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "86064d37-696e-4a0a-b5d4-812f2080d2e6",
                                "sense_id": "11b711ee-ac2a-33fd-b5c0-a7207bfaf3f3",
                                "text": "И Митя очнулся, весь в поту, с потрясающе ясным сознанием, что он погиб, что в мире так чудовищно безнадежно и мрачно, как не может быть и в преисподней, за могилой."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0dcfce25-30a1-416e-bc03-c95b9fbe2a40",
                                "sense_id": "11b711ee-ac2a-33fd-b5c0-a7207bfaf3f3",
                                "text": "Как потрясающе быстро все сдались, пали духом!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dd895d00-765e-4398-97c3-0641f874f844",
                                "sense_id": "11b711ee-ac2a-33fd-b5c0-a7207bfaf3f3",
                                "text": "Ищенко был потрясающе спокоен."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "17b01d22-eb5f-4c21-a6d5-12a5979a044b",
                                "sense_id": "11b711ee-ac2a-33fd-b5c0-a7207bfaf3f3",
                                "text": "Марта, радость моя, ты потрясающе элегантна!"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cfa86b12-2415-3cc5-a4f4-e9a5ffe0f185",
                        "entry_id": "041ae16f-efdc-3f15-9538-576059658294",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. прекрасно, великолепно"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8b900158-6eb9-45e3-94cf-31090198f591",
                                "sense_id": "cfa86b12-2415-3cc5-a4f4-e9a5ffe0f185",
                                "text": "— Гелла, садись, — приказал Воланд и объяснил Маргарите: — Ночь полнолуния — праздничная ночь, и я ужинаю в тесной компании приближенных и слуг. Итак, как чувствуете вы себя? Как прошёл этот утомительный бал? — Потрясающе! — затрещал Коровьев, — все очарованы, влюблены, раздавлены, сколько такта, сколько умения, обаяния и шарма!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "374991c0-dcf1-492f-89b3-042299ee91ca",
                                "sense_id": "cfa86b12-2415-3cc5-a4f4-e9a5ffe0f185",
                                "text": "— О! Ты потрясающе сегодня выглядишь, — сделал он ей комплимент и чмокнул в щеку."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4187a99f-ea7c-3b04-be2d-644744ada6a3",
                        "entry_id": "041ae16f-efdc-3f15-9538-576059658294",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. обалдеть!, ничего себе!, здо́рово!, вау!"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "межд."
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f053f4ca-f389-4328-8487-48f9e9013d91",
                                "sense_id": "4187a99f-ea7c-3b04-be2d-644744ada6a3",
                                "text": "— А к Новому году он обещал мне «мерседес». — Потрясающе!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c22a787a-9b4b-43a5-b5f3-9a13f2469d64",
                        "source_entry_id": "041ae16f-efdc-3f15-9538-576059658294",
                        "target_lang_word": "amazingly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "amazingly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f4e3c572-29ac-3f16-88f5-aff64cc94ed9",
                                        "entry_id": "79f7d897-b2b6-345a-977a-7c0e4b867fac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In an amazing manner; in a way that causes amazement; wonderfully."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b4398029-fe65-4e86-b94f-3d3c6b466f7d",
                                                "sense_id": "f4e3c572-29ac-3f16-88f5-aff64cc94ed9",
                                                "text": "That violin solo was played amazingly."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "52598c2f-e63a-4edd-9940-69d360039eb1",
                                                "sense_id": "f4e3c572-29ac-3f16-88f5-aff64cc94ed9",
                                                "text": "While at first in the U.S.A. it may have been a matter of high-pressure salesmanship—and it has undoubtely been the irresistible enterprise of the General Motors Corporation, through its Electro-Motive subsidiary, that has set in motion this amazingly rapid transformation of American railway motive power, and has caused all the steam locomotive builders in the U.S.A. to follow suit or be left out in the cold—it seems now beyond dispute that, so far as the U.S.A. is concerned, the economics of the power question can be solved no other way."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3481d11f-6bb5-3cb9-9e49-e67f5ae3640d",
                                        "entry_id": "79f7d897-b2b6-345a-977a-7c0e4b867fac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Difficult to believe; strange but true."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c126aba-30ec-4766-b567-f8e374b1f39d",
                                                "sense_id": "3481d11f-6bb5-3cb9-9e49-e67f5ae3640d",
                                                "text": "Amazingly, no one was injured in the crash."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da94ad3b-671e-4197-9cb9-446127be676b",
                                                "sense_id": "3481d11f-6bb5-3cb9-9e49-e67f5ae3640d",
                                                "text": "Signalman Bridges was killed by the blast, as was fireman Nightall. Amazingly, driver Gimbert came round some 200 yards away, on the grass outside the Station Hotel where he had been flung."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9a7525e7-6762-3e89-822d-8dae09eced1b",
                                        "entry_id": "79f7d897-b2b6-345a-977a-7c0e4b867fac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To a wonder-inspiring extent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd227fff-34b0-4794-8367-a21f5fa01455",
                                                "sense_id": "9a7525e7-6762-3e89-822d-8dae09eced1b",
                                                "text": "The car has amazingly low fuel consumption."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "95d038e8-feab-40ae-975c-6325f9ef4331",
                                                "sense_id": "9a7525e7-6762-3e89-822d-8dae09eced1b",
                                                "text": "The disease AIDS is wiping out a significant portion of the Gay Community and concerns about it are well-justified. But there is another disease that strikes an amazingly high percentage in our community. This disease is Chemical Dependency."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2524d842-8581-46fe-bfdd-e8e2ffef16b8",
                        "source_entry_id": "041ae16f-efdc-3f15-9538-576059658294",
                        "target_lang_word": "astonishingly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "astonishingly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b3fc3131-7a84-302f-bd62-8187485fd6fd",
                                        "entry_id": "48409df0-6680-361c-b2e3-4006b9841ca7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In an astonishing manner; so as to surprise or astonish."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "181df71b-081a-416c-840f-bee8f6f8f0e9",
                                                "sense_id": "b3fc3131-7a84-302f-bd62-8187485fd6fd",
                                                "text": "Famous hotels, for instance, are astonishingly commonplace."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9967b92d-9d18-342e-97d4-bbc498d42375",
                                        "entry_id": "48409df0-6680-361c-b2e3-4006b9841ca7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Very; remarkably used as an intensifier."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e7a91c8-d97c-448a-89d6-92c798190688",
                                                "sense_id": "9967b92d-9d18-342e-97d4-bbc498d42375",
                                                "text": "The advertisements made the place look promising, but the food was astonishingly bad."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1d5e70d-f793-43dc-a729-a53791e0fa3d",
                                                "sense_id": "9967b92d-9d18-342e-97d4-bbc498d42375",
                                                "text": "“Republican frontrunner Donald Trump used a campaign stop in Michigan on Monday to make astonishingly sexist attacks against Democratic frontrunner Hillary Clinton,” the left-leaning ThinkProgress wrote."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "29c1ab8a-6f9b-4f99-a6e2-79cf59717a90",
                        "source_entry_id": "041ae16f-efdc-3f15-9538-576059658294",
                        "target_lang_word": "fantastically",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fantastically",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8f5cd992-b14e-38c1-8a26-eea597b51231",
                                        "entry_id": "4ebaf7a7-ca1e-3533-a9f0-72fe16baed93",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a fantastic manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19da674d-ca56-4ced-8b87-2a698a01a294",
                                                "sense_id": "8f5cd992-b14e-38c1-8a26-eea597b51231",
                                                "text": "He painted fantastically with everything as if in a dream."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94aa1268-9398-4504-81f4-baffb22d555b",
                                                "sense_id": "8f5cd992-b14e-38c1-8a26-eea597b51231",
                                                "text": "\"The Chengtu revolutionaries were fantastically colourful in the Szechwanese manner—they costumed themselves as heroes of the stage and their energies were chiefly occupied in tying ropes across the main streets so that when Imperial officials rode by in their litters they would have to get down and crawl under, losing face."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3207386e-5933-3ea7-87fb-b1f5a302d166",
                                        "entry_id": "4ebaf7a7-ca1e-3533-a9f0-72fe16baed93",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To an extent only in fantasy; outrageously; ridiculously."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f946b455-cbe3-4927-a60e-9aef87bc78f7",
                                                "sense_id": "3207386e-5933-3ea7-87fb-b1f5a302d166",
                                                "text": "The provinces of Liaoning, Heilongjiang and Jilin are fantastically cold in winter, indeed one of the major tourist attractions for the hardy is the display of ice-carved figures in public parks (especially in Haerbin, Heilongjiang province). The long winters have average temperatures between — 20°C and — 27°C, although the short summers are hot."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa219e9f-73b3-43b7-9945-f362fe30c77b",
                                                "sense_id": "3207386e-5933-3ea7-87fb-b1f5a302d166",
                                                "text": "He was fantastically wealthy."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9e85a316-329c-44ea-8bfd-2d1c650c55b9",
                                                "sense_id": "3207386e-5933-3ea7-87fb-b1f5a302d166",
                                                "text": "One must be especially careful when using Google to determine frequency as there is a very real risk of fantastically overestimating the frequency and subsequent importance of a term."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3eb390a2-13b7-45c2-8ef1-93f89088eaa9",
                                                "sense_id": "3207386e-5933-3ea7-87fb-b1f5a302d166",
                                                "text": "Every guest is appalled and fantastically humourless about the experience, even at this distance. You cannot help but wonder at cultural divides and how differently the British might have approached – or at least recalled – such events, at least in the early days. For us, surely, it would be a story for the ages. You could dine out on it for ever, so to speak."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
